{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "05ab481c6280c43d397dd47134d8b358caddb8139dd8740743b3664d430ca821", "ja": "もうすぐ本番ですね。\n……はぁ、ちょっと緊張してきました。", "zh": "就快要开始正式拍摄了呢。\n……呼，开始觉得有点紧张了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6640b98e57ed15fb95a1a48b46e771c4d40a471195856d6bce962eb14434238f", "ja": "はは、やっぱり春香も、まだ緊張するんだな。", "zh": "哈哈，果然春香也还是会紧张啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "48cfaf49a9ae6a9a3b2db7d4c3b2cff0d0da0b8c5dcab7a5a5e168f2cfc48b80", "ja": "もう、当たり前じゃないですか～。\nそりゃ、最初の頃に比べれば大丈夫ですけど……。", "zh": "真是的，那还用说吗～\n虽然和一开始比起来是已经好很多了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "1d1b48817fad37414b3c1b4cf61204872d2871b160536f0a70debd451e2160e3", "ja": "でも、それだって……。\n{$P$}さんのおかげですけどね。", "zh": "不过，紧张的状况能够改善……\n也是多亏了{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "49acbf2351e5d89d68ffbffe612f26fb2289e42f3a94ffd10b19704627d56ae7", "ja": "{$P$}さんが見ててくれてるって\nわかってるから、安心できるのかなって……えへへっ。", "zh": "或许是我知道{$P$}先生\n就在看着自己，所以才能感到安心吧……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "1e448509303da54861da851ea25921b3a1b4531da778fd3391926eab5bb54357", "ja": "あっ、出番みたいです。それじゃ……\n今日も行ってきますね、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "啊，好像换我了，那么……\n我今天也要上场啰，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
